        "id": "SejuaniPassive",
        "name": "Fury of the North",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "After being out of combat, Sejuani gains Frost Armor which grants Armor and Magic Resist and immunity to slows. Frost Armor persists for a short time after Sejuani takes damage.  Sejuani can damage a stunned enemy to shatter it, dealing massive magic damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Sejuani becomes immune to <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> and gains <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(10 + (75% bonus Armor)) Armor</span> and <span>(10 + (75% bonus Magic Resist)) Magic Resist</span> after not taking damage from champions or large jungle monsters for (12 ~ 6) seconds.<br /><br />Sejuani's first Attack against enemies she has <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">10% max Health magic damage</span>.",
        "iconFile": "Sejuani_passive.png",
