        "id": "SejuaniW",
        "name": "Winter's Wrath",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Sejuani swings her mace twice, dealing damage, slowing enemies and applying Frost stacks.",
        "bodyHtml": "Sejuani swings her flail, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/15/25/35/45 + (30% Ability Power) + (4% Health)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Back</span> minions and jungle monsters. She then lashes out again, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/25/45/65/85 + (60% Ability Power) + (8% Health)) physical damage</span> and briefly <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> targets.<br /><br />Both swings apply stacks of <span>Permafrost</span>.",
